---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | CalcPath"
  description="CalcPath privacy policy. All calculations run in your browser. We never see, store, or transmit the numbers you enter."
>
  <div class="max-w-[768px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-8">Last updated: February 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Email address only</strong> — and only if you choose to receive your calculator
          results via email. We never require an account, password, or any personal financial data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Calculator Data</h2>
        <p>
          All calculations run client-side in your browser. We never see, store, or transmit the
          numbers you enter into our calculators. Your financial data stays on your device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics with anonymized IP addresses to understand how people use the site.
          We track page views, traffic sources, and device types. We do not track individual users,
          financial data, or personal information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          We use analytics cookies only when you consent. No advertising cookies, no tracking pixels,
          no third-party data sharing. You can decline cookies and the site works exactly the same —
          we just won't have analytics data for your visit.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Email Usage</h2>
        <p>
          If you provide your email to receive calculator results, we use it solely for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Sending your requested calculator results</li>
          <li>Occasional educational content related to your calculator</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Your email is never sold, shared, or given to third parties. Every email includes an
          unsubscribe link. We use MailerLite as our email provider.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Affiliate Links</h2>
        <p>
          We link to third-party financial products on some pages. When you click an affiliate link,
          that company's privacy policy applies. We do not share your data with affiliate partners.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Your Rights (GDPR/CCPA)</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Request deletion of your data (email us)</li>
          <li>Access the data we have about you</li>
          <li>Opt out of email communications at any time</li>
          <li>Decline analytics cookies</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">
          For any privacy-related requests, contact us at privacy@calcpath.com.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          CalcPath is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from
          children under 13.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
